  "description": "This plugin allows you to add Banners, Collapsible Banners, Interstitials, Rewarded Videos, App Open Ads, Native Ads and Consent form to your Android and iOS projects in just a line of code. Version 3 runs Android on the Google Mobile Ads Next-Gen SDK; from 3.1 you can show your own view in banner slots AdMob can't fill.",
