  "readmeFile": "readmeMauiNG.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.1: banner fallback. Show your own view (for example a promotion of your other apps) in a banner slot AdMob could not fill, with no hidden requests: the AdMob view is destroyed meanwhile and retried after 60 s, 2 and 5 min while the banner is on screen.\n- New: CrossMauiMTAdmob.Current.BannerFallback (IMTBannerFallback, free and licensed) and MTAdView.UseFallback.\n- Changed: MTAdView.AdSize defaults to AnchoredAdaptive on Android and iOS (Android used to default to 320x50: set AdSize=\"Banner\" to keep it).\n- Fixed: hidden banners (IsVisible = false) load only once visible; iOS honours AdSize and no longer fails a banner shown after being hidden; Android no longer loses AdsImpression / OnAdPaid of a banner loading into a visible slot; no crash when a page closes while its banner loads; narrow ads are centred.\n- Debug mode logs each banner request, and says when ads wait for InitialiseConsent() because SkipConsent is on.\nFull notes: https://github.com/marcojak/MauiMTAdmob/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
